guide forever/professions/fishing-cooking
title Fishing + Cooking 1-300
category Professions
kind profession
skills Fishing, Cooking
coords era
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Fishing and Cooking 1-300 together, for both factions: each Cooking stretch starts with a Fishing
# step sized to the fish that stretch still needs, which also raises Fishing, and the cooking
# follows with the fish in your bags. Spares carry to the next stretch, and when a stretch needs a
# fish Fishing cannot catch yet, Fishing catches up first. Fishing reaches 300 before the last
# Cooking stretch.
#
# Each Fishing step offers its band's waters as farming loops: a round of stands, the places players
# stood when they caught the band's fish (Polestar_Recorder sessions, three or more players each),
# leaving out stands near creatures more than a level above the band's level (an elite counts three
# levels higher), near the other faction's towns and guards, and boat docks. The arrow takes the one
# water that gets you the fish soonest from where you are, travel included, and walks its stands; a
# water's lap counts the hostile creatures by its stands and the deaths players' recordings show
# there, so the quieter water wins a close call. Starting areas to 75, the capitals and other
# Longjaw Mud Snapper and catfish water to 150, catfish water to 190, Mithril Head Trout water to
# 225, Nat Pagle for Artisan, then Spotted Yellowtail water to 300.
#
# What bites at a water: the recorded catches at its stands (100 or more), else the zone's fishing
# loot from Forever's server data; when a water loses no fish: its base fishing skill + 95
# (Forever's server data). Recipes, their skill colours, prices and sellers are the data's
# (professions.json, Cooking). The fish can be bought at the Auction House instead of caught
# (Gather, Buy or Mix).
#
# ASSUMED: catches per point follow Classic's rate (every catch below 75, then one in (skill - 50) /
# 25), averaged over each band; cooking skill-ups the Classic chance; a loop's lap is its walk at 7
# yards a second, five casts of 12 seconds at each stand, 20 seconds for each hostile creature by a
# stand and three minutes for each death recorded there, per catch.
#
# Not routed: the Ravaged Fishing Pole (one source, no loot row in the server data), Recipe: Plated
# Armorfish (one source), the Winter Frontier Fishery quests (Winter Squid only bites in winter).
#
# Spawns come from the reference data: the Era baseline (pfQuest) plus the node spawns Forever's
# beta sniffs add (Zephras Isle, the starting-area Poor Copper Veins and herbs: the Forever
# TrinityCore world DB); trainer learn skills and prices from Forever's sniffed trainer lists;
# recipes and their skill colours from the Forever client tables (`forge data professions`).
# ASSUMED: past level 30 (the beta's cap) Forever's spawns are Classic's; nothing confirms them yet.
# In-game check: refine with Polestar_Recorder sessions. Rank level gates: Journeyman Fishing asks
# level 10 (Forever's sniffed trainer list); Cooking's and First Aid's Journeyman ask none (their
# sniffed lists, and players' recordings train them at 6 and 7). In-game check: reading an Expert
# book below level 20. Waypoints are Era-frame (`coords era`); the engine converts them where
# Forever changed a map frame, and a map without an Era frame (Zephras Isle) compiles live.
# About 10 hours of fishing in 8 gathering stretches; it gathers about 460 Raw Rockscale Cod, 230
# Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper, 170 Raw Spotted Yellowtail, 140 Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish, 140 Firefin
# Snapper and 120 Oily Blackmouth.
#
# Cooking turns the fish into food: each recipe here is a vendor recipe whose fish the band you fish
# then gives, the one with the best chance of a skill-up at each point (orange first, the one already
# on when two tie). Recipes and spices are bought from the vendor nearest you; Expert Cooking is a
# book and Artisan Cooking is Clamlette Surprise in Tanaris.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice (1-75)
section Cooking 1-75

step Learn Fishing and Cooking
  tip Any Cooking trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Cooking (1s) at any character level; the arrow picks the nearest, and every starting area has one. Forever: every cook knows Basic Campfire: a Basic Campfire Kit from one Simple Wood with Flint and Tinder lights a cooking fire anywhere, so you can cook beside the water. If you sat at your starting area's campfire for The Great Outdoors, its camping guide also offers Camping 101: Fishing (handed in at Fishing 20 for the Fish Bowl recipe) and Camping 101: Cooking. Learn Apprentice Fishing on the same trip: any Fishing trainer of your faction teaches it at any level, and the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a Fishing Pole (23c) and equip it: you can only fish with a pole in your hands.
  train Cooking Apprentice
  train Fishing Apprentice
  buy 6256 x1 nearest
  skill Cooking 1

step Lures for Fishing 1-75
  when !skill Fishing 25
  tip Some of these waters lose fish below Fishing 25: a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes. Shiny Bauble (+25, 50c each) closes the gap from 1: about 1 sees you to 25 (6 minutes of fishing).
  buy 6529 x1 nearest

step Fish Raw Brilliant Smallfish (Fishing 1-75)
  only Human,Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne,Tauren,Undead
  tip 50 Raw Brilliant Smallfish for Cooking 1-50: 50 Brilliant Smallfish. Fish 50 Raw Brilliant Smallfish (Fishing 1 to 75), then craft 50 Brilliant Smallfish (Cooking 1 to 50). The arrow takes the Fishing loop that gets you them soonest from where you are and walks it until your bags hold them; the window names the loop, its lap and the laps left. At the water it leads stand to stand: stay while you catch fish (casting holds the arrow there), walk on when a pool is fished out or the spot is busy. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 6291 x50 gather Fishing 1
  loop Elwynn Forest lvl 2 lap 338 yield 15.3 only Alliance r 15 at 47.1,64.0 47.5,63.2 48.8,63.3 48.9,65.1 46.5,64.6
  loop Dun Morogh lvl 2 lap 126 yield 6.2 only Alliance r 15 at 35.5,40.6 35.4,40.0
  loop Zephras Isle lvl 6 lap 175 yield 6.1 only Skyborne,Alliance live r 15 at 46.9,48.5 46.0,48.8
  loop Mulgore lvl 2 lap 146 yield 6.1 only Horde r 15 at 44.5,61.2 43.8,58.8
  loop Tirisfal Glades lvl 2 lap 137 yield 4.6 only Horde r 15 at 66.4,48.6 66.9,50.5
  loop Zephras Isle lvl 6 lap 175 yield 6.1 only Skyborne,Horde live r 15 at 46.9,48.5 46.0,48.8
  auction 6291 x50

