  tip Bristle Whisker Catfish is yellow at 150 (yellow 140, green 160, grey 180): about 69 crafts to 175, up to 86 for 9 players in 10 (the fish above count that many). Each takes 1 Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own Basic Campfire. If you got here without learning Bristle Whisker Catfish, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it.
